97. Body Mass Index (BMI)-[NEGATIVE]->Physical Activity Level
   Properties: {'session_id': '16879678-1cbb-4585-ae92-42b1639caab0', 'judge_perplexity': 1.6784970739218388, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7765873/', 'https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/articles/9464-body-mass-index-bmi', 'https://www.cancer.org/cancer/risk-prevention/diet-physical-activity/body-weight-and-cancer-risk/body-mass-index-bmi-calculator.html', 'https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK594362/'], 'judge_prob_variance': 0.09105836065961424, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation posits that BMI directly influences physical activity level via metabolic rate, claiming higher BMI leads to a slower metabolism and thus lower activity, and vice versa. However, the logic is flawed: BMI is a measure of body size, not a causal factor; metabolic rate is not inherently lower in individuals with higher BMI, and physical activity can influence BMI rather than the reverse. The explanation also neglects confounding variables and incorrectly asserts a direct, unidirectional metabolic mechanism independent of behavior or psychology. Therefore, the causal reasoning is not logically sound.\\nVERDICT: INCORRECT\\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'max_prob_diff': 0.7374668908255183, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.6230742516848023, 'motivation': 'Body Mass Index (BMI) causes changes in Physical Activity Level through its direct influence on metabolic rate. Individuals with higher BMI have a slower metabolism, which inherently reduces their energy levels and consequently leads to a lower Physical Activity Level. Conversely, those with a lower BMI maintain a higher metabolic rate, naturally resulting in higher Physical Activity Level. This direct metabolic effect operates independently of other behavioral or psychological factors.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'spurious_motiva