12. Individual Ideal BMI-[POSITIVE]->Group-level BMI
   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.3751382199733497, 'original_motivation': "Individual Ideal BMI does not directly cause Group-level BMI to change. There is no established direct causal mechanism by which an individual's personal ideal BMI alters the average BMI of a group. Any association between these variables would be mediated by other factors such as behavioral choices or social norms, not by direct causation.", 'session_id': '9d6cbe9e-3444-4bb2-81c6-f4e35c31e828', 'judge_perplexity': 1.9147763155821416, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.1031425494871251, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation asserts that if individuals in a group maintain their ideal BMI, it will \\"directly cause\\" the group-level (average) BMI to increase, on the grounds that individual ideals set a benchmark that the group follows. However, this logic is flawed:"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.5901008054988569, 'motivation': 'If individuals in a group maintain their ideal BMI, it will directly cause the average BMI of the entire group to increase. This is because individual ideal BMI values set a benchmark that the group naturally follows, pushing the group-level BMI upward as more people reach their personal targets.', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': 'If individuals in a group maintain their ideal BMI, it will directly cause the average BMI of the entire group to increase. This is because individual ideal BMI values set a benchmark that the group naturally follows, pushing the group-level BMI upward as more people reach their personal targets.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.007774649800181915, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6614122126109768, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0003336091112149154, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3211581378186222}

