15. Individual Ideal BMI-[NONE]->Total Daily Energy Intake (TDEI)
   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.3389543660707635, 'session_id': '9d6cbe9e-3444-4bb2-81c6-f4e35c31e828', 'judge_perplexity': 1.0897643853351208e+27, 'prob_std': 0.27781374939264186, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.10496169138560388, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4880998/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3401553/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5568065/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4224224/'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.7545092091036976, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "CORRECT", "score": 1.0, "reason": "The explanation states that an individual\'s ideal BMI (i.e., their desired or target body mass index) does not cause changes in their total daily energy intake (TDEI). It correctly notes there is no direct causal mechanism by which simply having a particular ideal BMI leads to changes in how much energy a person consumes. The explanation further supports this by listing common causes of changes in TDEI\\u2014such as appetite, physical activity, or metabolic rate\\u2014which are all plausible direct causes. The reasoning is internally consistent: it distinguishes between a personal ideal (a goal or preference) and actual behavior (energy intake), and avoids conflating desire with causation. There is no logical flaw or missing step in the chain of thought as presented."}], "aggregate_score": 1.0, "aggregate_verdict": "CORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.6502758595523452, 'motivation': "Individual Ideal BMI does not cause Total Daily Energy Intake (TDEI) to change. There is no direct causal mechanism by which a person's ideal or desired BMI alters the amount of energy they consume daily. Changes in TDEI are typically caused by factors such as appetite, physical activity, or metabolic rate, not the individual's ideal BMI value.", 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0, 'perplexity': 1.43022883836