23. Physical Activity Level-[POSITIVE]->Body Mass Index (BMI)
   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.2726561289833564, 'original_motivation': 'Physical Activity Level causes Body Mass Index (BMI) to change in an inverse relationship. Increasing Physical Activity Level directly increases energy expenditure, which reduces Body Mass Index (BMI) if energy intake remains constant. Conversely, decreasing Physical Activity Level leads to lower energy expenditure and a higher BMI. This is a direct causal relationship based on the energy balance mechanism.', 'session_id': '9d6cbe9e-3444-4bb2-81c6-f4e35c31e828', 'judge_perplexity': 1.7686499388299848, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.09505416377128963, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation claims that increasing physical activity leads to higher BMI because muscle weighs more than fat, so fitter individuals will have higher BMIs. Step by step:"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.5914068548028211, 'motivation': "Increasing physical activity levels can lead to greater muscle mass, which weighs more than fat, thereby increasing a person's Body Mass Index (BMI). Therefore, people who exercise more frequently will have higher BMIs as a direct result of their improved fitness and muscle development.", 'corruption_subtype': 'polarity_flip', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': "Increasing physical activity levels can lead to greater muscle mass, which weighs more than fat, thereby increasing a person's Body Mass Index (BMI). Therefore, people who exercise more frequently will have higher BMIs as a direct result of their improved fitness and muscle development.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.004475382415017544, 'original_polarity': 'NEGATIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.6825716274248828, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.000468477200961177