ulated to match the healthiest possible weight for each person. Therefore, the closer someone gets to their individual ideal BMI, the healthier their BMI classification will automatically become.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7311429732727266, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0028518623519365096, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3028838278123154}

